<div class="page-header"><h1>Kitchen Cabinets in New Mexico</h1><p>From Albuquerque to the design-driven market of Santa Fe and down to Las Cruces, New Mexico homeowners and designers can spec the full Pinnacle Sales lineup — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets — through independent local showrooms.</p></div>
