<h2 id="new-mexico-kitchen-design-trends">New Mexico Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>New Mexico kitchens balance Southwestern warmth with contemporary refinement. Albuquerque favors transitional kitchens with warm-painted and stained combinations, while Santa Fe's renowned design culture spans Pueblo-revival warmth, hand-finished textures, and an increasingly modern, gallery-like aesthetic in the high-end market. Warm woods, custom paint from <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh</a>, and clean <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> or handleless fronts all find a home here.</p>
